# When the handler of a warning recovers instead, the body unwinds:
# the cleanups between the warning and the trap run, then the trap
# gives the handler's value.
== SOURCE
'{ @ -> '{ @ -> 10 + (0 []W_ARN "empty" "nothing") } []E_NSURE '{ @ -> p_rint! "cleaned" } } []T_RAP '{ e -> p_rint! "handled"; []R_ECOVER 99 }
== TYPE
Int
== RESULT
handled
cleaned
99
